{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Y1fx6Mc2MI1795349474.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地第二艘國產大型郵輪「愛達‧花城號」今日開啟商業首航。</p><p></p><p>首航儀式上午舉行，奧運跳水冠軍郭晶晶受邀擔任啟航大使，並為「愛達‧花城號」正式命名。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CRUISE-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026c1co4pL7QY1795349483.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>到傍晚超過3,800名遊客，從廣州南沙國際郵輪母港出發，開啟6日5晚的首航。期間會經香港、越南順化，之後返回廣州。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CRUISE-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nzFYqcu7eI1795349494.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:24:16.304493+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:57:12.499439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:26.398249+00:00","content_hash":"08e3ad84d9ca62878ea2c0b2a38992af2accf913a63bce8d4948c8882a22cfd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:24:16.304493+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}